014","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"conceptual","question":"Which condition ensures continuity everywhere for the Weierstrass function?","options":["$a=0$ only","$0 \\lt a \\lt 1$","$ab=0$","$b=1$ only"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"f9853fd58ad766401ef29a36","time_limit":20},{"id":"year_1_2a_math_iii_analysis_weierstrass_function_eaa2b515_015","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"conceptual","question":"What differentiability property is the Weierstrass function famous for?","options":["It can be continuous everywhere but nowhere differentiable.","It is continuous everywhere but not differentiable at $x=0$ only.","It is differentiable everywhere but continuous at no point.","It is nowhere continuous, since its terms oscillate ever faster."],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"66ad9337c19fe3430f230796","time_limit":25},{"id":"year_1_2a_math_iii_analysis_weierstrass_function_eaa2b515_016","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"application","question":"Find values of $a$ and $b$ satisfying $0 \\lt a \\lt 1$ and $ab \\gt 1$.","options":["$a=2$, $b=3$","$a=\\frac{1}{2}$, $b=1$","$a=0$, $b=3$","$a=\\frac{1}{2}$, $b=3$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"6c4ffa0957ae02a5dac5c1ee","time_limit":30},{"id":"year_1_2a_math_iii_analysis_weierstrass_function_eaa2b515_017","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"application","question":"Which function has the form of a Weierstrass function?","options":["$\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}2^n\\cos(3^n x)$","$\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{2^n}\\cos(3^n x)$","$\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n^2}\\cos(3^n x)$","$\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{2^n}\\cos(3n x)$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"e0b673cff0eddb2e8fa232d4","time_limit":20},{"id":"year_1_2a_math_iii_analysis_weierstrass_function_eaa2b515_018","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"application","question":"For $a=\\frac{1}{4}$ and $b=8$, what is $ab$?","options":["$\\frac{1}{2}$","$8$","$2$","$\\frac{1}{4}$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedb